@@ -26,6 +26,8 @@ Enable the existing base-bundle row in a later composition patch and restate its
 
 Loading the row is the enablement decision. It supplies the optional `imageInputBridge` admission capability, registers `vision_inspect`, and installs the durable reminder hook. There is no model preset or global prompt mutation.
 
+The package's browser half registers a dedicated `vision_inspect` Tool row at the same enablement boundary. It uses a viewfinder-eye icon and `Vision` title instead of the generic Tool call label. Its running `ing` suffix, elapsed-time counter, and sweep motion follow the Think row, while the disclosure retains the exact durable input and output. When the bridge is disabled, this keyed presentation is absent and the package exposes no visual Tool UI.
+
 ## Durable history and KV cache
 
 The reminder is generated only while a newly claimed human message contains image blocks. It is inserted immediately after that message and appended by the ordinary agent loop as another durable `user/message`. Later turns replay that exact event; the plugin does not remove, regenerate, move, or re-inject old reminders. Thus the prior conversation remains an append-only request prefix and can reuse the same KV-cache entries as ordinary text history.
